  DEC_FUNC -->|when 'REST'| IO_REST
  DEC_FUNC -->|when 'STAT'| PARA_6000
  DEC_FUNC -->|other| CALL_ERRPROC
  PARA_1000 --> TERMINAL
  RULE_BR043 --> DEC_COMMIT
  DEC_COMMIT -->|yes / true| IO_COMMIT
  DEC_COMMIT -->|no / false| TERMINAL
  IO_COMMIT --> DEC_SQL
  IO_RBACK --> DEC_SQL
  IO_SAVE --> DEC_SQL
  IO_REST --> DEC_SQL
  DEC_SQL -->|yes / true| SET_OK
  DEC_SQL -->|no / false| CALL_DB2ERR
  SET_OK --> TERMINAL
  CALL_DB2ERR --> TERMINAL
  PARA_6000 --> TERMINAL
  CALL_ERRPROC --> TERMINAL

